funds and may be revised as a result, Economy Minister Mihaly Varga told a news conference.\par \par \uc2 Hungarian banks should cut mortgage spreads-central banker Nagy\par \par \uc2 Hungarian commercial banks should sharply cut mortgage interest rate spreads which have remained high even though \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  interest rates have fallen to record lows, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Governor Marton Nagy said.\par \par \uc2 Hungary cbank\uc2  vice governor says enjoys governor's confidence\par \par \uc2 National Bank of Hungary\uc2  (NBH) Vice Governor Marton Nagy said a recent reduction of his responsibilities was a signal of changing portfolios at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and not waning confidence in him. (Reporting by Gergely Szakacs) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2017-3-8T07:44:58.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020170308ed38008w2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
