e was guaranteed by the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Multilateral Investment Guarantee Agency\f28 \uc2 \f2 , which is part of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 World Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  Group. The guarantee helped secure a triple-A rating for 95% of the bonds with rating firm \f28 \uc2 \f2 Fitch Ratings\f28 \uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Sean Carney at sean.carney@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Go to \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://blogs.wsj.com/emergingeurope/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://blogs.wsj.com/emergingeurope/}}}\uc2 \f2  for the WSJ blog on Central and Eastern Europe, covering business, politics, society and more, written by our correspondents across the region. [ 26-09-13 0157GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1806 75091   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130926e99q0001u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
