ht22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Facility Available for 3 Months-Matolcsy\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:12 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Hungary \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  HUF Loan Facility Available Until End-August-Matolcsy\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:12 EDT *DJ  Hungary Matolcsy: Another Facility to Convert SMEs' \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Loans Into Forint Loans\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:14 EDT *DJ  Hungary to Cut 2-Week Bond Stock to HUF3.6 Trillion-Matolcsy\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:15 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Hungary \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  To Use \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Reserves to Cut 2-Wk Bond Stock-Matolcsy\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:16 EDT *DJ  Hungary To Cut 2-Wk Bond Stock by HUF1T from HUF4.5 Tln-Matolcsy\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:16 EDT *DJ  Hungary Matolcsy: \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Reserves May Drop By EUR3 Bln\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:17 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Hungary \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to Offer \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Swaps to Reduce 2-Wk Bond Stock-Matolcsy\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:17 EDT *DJ  Hungary Matolcsy: Will Meet CEOs of Eight Biggest Hungary Banks Apr 8\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:17 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Hungary \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wants to Lower Hungary Short-term Loan Exposure-Matolcsy\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:18 EDT *DJ  Hungary Matolcsy: Goal Is To Boost Growth, Cut Cost Of Financing\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:19 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Hungary \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to Consult Govt, Retail Banks on Steps-Matolcsy\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:20 EDT *DJ  Hungary Matolcsy: Program Targeted, Effects May Be Limited In Size\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:21 EDT *DJ  Hungary Financial Vulnerability May Decrease on Program- Matolcsy\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:22 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Hungary \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Governor: Program May Up Lending by 7%\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:23 EDT *DJ  \uc2 Hungary \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Program May Boost GDP by up to 0.7 Pct Pt\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:25 EDT *DJ  Hungary Matolcsy: SME \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Loan Conversion to Take Place at Market HUF Rate\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:29 EDT *DJ  Hungary Rate Setter Bartfai-Mager: MPC Will Finalize Program Apr. 30\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:35 EDT *DJ  Hungary Matolcsy: Informed EU Of \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Program's Nature\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:36 EDT *DJ  Hungary Bartfai-Mager: MPC Acts In Line With \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Law\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:36 EDT *DJ  Hungary Bartfai-Mager: Program No Threat To CPI Targeting Mandate\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:39 EDT *DJ  Hungary Matolcsy: Program to Affect \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Balance Sheet by up to HUF500B\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:39 EDT *DJ  Hungary Matolcsy: \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Has No \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange Rate Target\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:41 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  Matolcsy: \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Reserves Major Asset, Not Advised for HUF \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 05:42 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  Bartfai-Mager: Forint May Even Strengthen On Program\par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 06:58 EDT DJ  \uc2 Hungary \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to Ease SME Lending in Bid to Boost Growth\par \par \uc2 By Margit Feher and Veronika Gulyas\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday announced measures to ease lending to small and medium-size companies in a bid to support economic recovery while not putting the bank's price stability mandate at risk, new Governor Gyorgy Matolcsy said Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "Central banks are actively taking part these days in jump-starting growth, just look at the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I have informed the \uc2 European Union\uc2  of the nature of the program," Matolcsy said at a press conference, his first since he was appointed to the post by Prime Minister Viktor Orban in early March.\par \par \uc2 The program may boost gross domestic product growth up to 0.7 percentage point, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  projects. The bank forecasts this year's growth at 0.5% and the government, which is facing parliamentary elections next year, targets 0.9% growth.\par \par \uc2 Financial markets will "find that the program is precisely targeted to support growth and limited in its size and duration. It's a growth-promoting program," Mr. Matolcsy said.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Matolcsy, a close political ally of Mr. Orban, previously was economy minister and the architect of Hungary's much criticized unorthodox economic policies since 2010.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, if implemented fully, will reduce Hungary's mounting foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which totaled EUR35.89 billion ($46.02 billion) at the end of February, by up to EUR3 billion, he added. It will also increase the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's balance sheet by up to 500 billion forints ($2.12 billion), he said.\par \par \uc2 The first part of the lending program is a HUF250 billion facility to be offered to small and medium-size enterprises to provide them with relatively cheap loans. Under the facility, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  offers retail banks loans at an interest rate of 0%, while banks are allowed to charge a 2% interest rate to lend the funds on to the SMEs and are required to speed up the evaluation process of applicants.\par \par \uc2 The second part involves a HUF250 billion refinancing facility that allows SMEs to convert their foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  denominated loans into forint loans at the prevailing forint exchange rate on financial markets.\par \par \uc2 The refinancing facility is also offered to retail banks at a 0% interest rate. The program will be finalized April 30 after discussions with the country's eight biggest banks, analysts and the country's chamber of commerce and industry.\par \par \uc2 Both loan measures are planned to run for a three-month test period, starting June 1, Mr. Matolcsy said.\par \par \uc2 The third part of the program is a cap on retail banks' stock of two-week loans from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's key policy rate is the interest it pays to retail banks on their two-week bonds. Retail banks buy the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's two-week bonds, which is the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's main tool to increase or reduce liquidity in the financial system, with their excess cash. The policy rate is currently at a record low of 5%, after March's 25-basis-point rate cut, the eighth successive monthly cut.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will cap the stock, which currently stands at a record high of HUF4.5 trillion, to HUF3.6 trillion, by offering \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps to retail banks, using its foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves Mr. Matolcsy said. The measure is aimed at reducing Hungary's vulnerability, he added.\par \par \uc2 The top decision-making body of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Monetary Policy Council, approved at an extraordinary meeting Thursday the economic policy of the government in "a unified view," Mr. Matolcsy said.\par \par \uc2 Having met the inflation goal and with financial stability in place, the \uc2 National Bank of Hungary\uc2  may now support the government's economic policy, in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Act, Mr. Matolcsy said.\par \par \uc2 Inflation will be below or close to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 3% inflation target throughout the next two years, said MPC member Andrea Bartfai-Mager, who was also present at the briefing.\par \par \uc2 Write to Margit Feher at margit.feher@dowjones.com and Veronika Gulyas at veronika.gulyas@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 April 04, 2013 06:58 ET (10:58 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130404e944002jk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
